# The knowledge resource every corrupt fixture names.
#
# Present and empty on purpose. Each fixture must carry exactly one fault, and
# without this file every one of them would also report a missing knowledge
# resource — which is how the two warning fixtures came to fail a check they
# were written to pass. The `resource-absent` fixture names a different path
# deliberately.
#
# Nothing parses this at roadmap step 1.2: load confirms it resolves through the
# scene source and no more. Parsing TriG is the knowledge plane's work at step
# 5.1.
